{"data":"{\"contents\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"Write a vivid 70-word story about a lighthouse keeper who collects fog.\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Generating the Story**\\n\\nI've decided to move forward with the lighthouse keeper story. The word count is a little less than the target, but I believe I can craft a compelling narrative in that space. I'm focusing on the unique task of collecting fog, and will try to make sure I convey a sense of solitude and wonder.\\n\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true},{\"text\":\"Elara, the lighthouse keeper, lived a life of salty solitude. Her true passion wasn't just guiding ships, but collecting the very essence of the sea's breath: fog. Each swirling tendril that embraced her tower was carefully siphoned into ornate glass vials. Her cottage shelves gleamed with jars of thick, pearly mist, each labeled with the date and the specific mood of the sea it represented—\\\"Gloomy November,\\\" \\\"Whispering Dawn,\\\" \\\"Sorrowful Gale.\\\" She swore each jar hummed with a unique, silent song.\",\"thoughtSignature\":\"\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"Use run_command to print STREAM_PROBE, then tell me the result in one sentence.\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":4096,\"thinkingConfig\":{\"includeThoughts\":true}},\"systemInstruction\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"You are a helpful assistant built from raw HTTP calls in Chapter 1 of The Art of Building AI Coding Agents. Answer briefly.\"}]},\"tools\":[{\"functionDeclarations\":[{\"description\":\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"end_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]}},{\"description\":\"List immediate en